<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves fall in Feb.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves fall in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, fell $799 million to $20.682 billion in February, the central bank said in its latest monthly review of the economy.</p>
</text>
